---
title: Product Lifecycle State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft : Admin creates product (editable master data + price)

    Draft --> Published : publish (validations pass)
    Draft --> Inactive : discard a draft that will not be published

    Published --> Inactive : inactivate (end of sale, or superseded by a replacement SKU)

    Inactive --> [*]
